WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.642 --> 00:00:19.769
We're back!

00:00:21.062 --> 00:00:25.900
If you're far away, listen.
If you're close by, watch.

00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:29.237
I dare not be presumptuous
and introduce this robot.

00:00:30.905 --> 00:00:33.742
But if you must know, I will.

00:00:34.325 --> 00:00:36.995
A steel body and an electronic brain.

00:00:37.078 --> 00:00:40.123
Crying kids become silent
and silent kids start crying.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:43.251
This is Jet Jaguar!

00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:45.754
Finally, we meet.

00:00:48.089 --> 00:00:51.760
Yun! Take that kid and run!

00:00:51.801 --> 00:00:55.180
Let's fight fair and square…

00:00:57.599 --> 00:01:01.436
I wasn't finished! Wait until I'm done!

00:01:01.478 --> 00:01:03.229
Hold on!

00:01:06.107 --> 00:01:06.983
Stupid beast!

00:01:07.859 --> 00:01:10.111
What the heck?

00:01:10.945 --> 00:01:11.863
You punk.

00:01:11.946 --> 00:01:15.241
That hurts!

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:19.162
"Courtesan, how cruel of you."

00:01:21.539 --> 00:01:22.373
My arm!

00:01:24.793 --> 00:01:29.839
You can tear my body to pieces,
but I won't stop!

00:01:50.693 --> 00:01:52.821
How dare you!

00:01:54.531 --> 00:01:56.491
My precious Jet Jaguar…

00:01:56.574 --> 00:02:02.580
"I put out my hand
and accept an octopus tentacle!"

